  "discussion": "Displaying a logon banner to users each time they logon to systems can act as a way of reminding users of their security responsibilities. Logon banners may cover topics such as:\n\n- the sensitivity or classification of the system\n- access requirements for the system\n- usage policies for the system and its resources\n- details of any monitoring activities for the system.",
